    "seasonNo": 1,
    "episodeNo": 4,
    "id": 640,
    "lineNo": 3,
    "speaker": "Applejack",
    "dialogue": "Come on, big brother! You need to rest up and get yourself better. I haven't met an apple orchard yet that I can't handle. Oops, sorry. I'll take a bite out of this job by day's end."
