    "seasonNo": 1,
    "episodeNo": 4,
    "id": 644,
    "lineNo": 7,
    "speaker": "Applejack",
    "dialogue": "Why of all the... This is your sister Applejack, remember? The loyalest of friends and the most dependable of ponies?"
