    "seasonNo": 1,
    "episodeNo": 4,
    "id": 686,
    "lineNo": 49,
    "speaker": "Pinkie Pie",
    "dialogue": "Oh. Applejack, one of the best bakers ever, is gonna help me. Applejack makes everything great, so free samples for everypony!"
