    "seasonNo": 1,
    "episodeNo": 9,
    "id": 1901,
    "lineNo": 66,
    "speaker": "Twilight Sparkle",
    "dialogue": "And maybe she's not lurking by the stores. Maybe she's going to them, lurk-free, to do some shopping?"
