    "episodeId": 11,
    "seasonNo": 1,
    "episodeNo": 12,
    "id": 2544,
    "lineNo": 29,
    "speaker": "Apple Bloom",
    "dialogue": "But I don't want one eventually! I want one right now! I can't go to Diamond Tiara's cute-cea\u00f1era without one! I just can't!"
