    "seasonNo": 1,
    "episodeNo": 26,
    "id": 5727,
    "lineNo": 31,
    "speaker": "Spike",
    "dialogue": "I still can't believe we're gonna be at Canterlot tonight. Our hometown, Twilight! And the best part is that we all get to hang out together all night long!"
