    "seasonNo": 1,
    "episodeNo": 26,
    "id": 5744,
    "lineNo": 48,
    "speaker": "[Fluttershy]",
    "dialogue": "At the Gala~ In the garden~ I'm going to see them all~ All the creatures~ I'll befriend them at the Gala"
