    "seasonNo": 1,
    "episodeNo": 26,
    "id": 5746,
    "lineNo": 50,
    "speaker": "[Fluttershy]",
    "dialogue": "All the birdies~ And the critters~ They will love me big and small~ We'll become good friends forever~ Right here at the Gala!"
