    "seasonNo": 1,
    "episodeNo": 26,
    "id": 5748,
    "lineNo": 52,
    "speaker": "[Applejack]",
    "dialogue": "At the Gala (It's amazing)~ I will sell them (Better hurry)~ All my appletastic treats (Yummy yummy)~ Hungry ponies (They'll be snacking)~ They will buy them (Bring your money)~ Caramel apples, apple sweets (Gimme some)~ And I'll earn a lot of money~ for the Apple family!"
