    "episodeId": 25,
    "seasonNo": 1,
    "episodeNo": 26,
    "id": 5750,
    "lineNo": 54,
    "speaker": "[Rarity]",
    "dialogue": "At the Gala~ All the royals~ They will meet fair Rarity~ They will see I'm just as regal at the Gala"
