    "seasonNo": 1,
    "episodeNo": 26,
    "id": 5775,
    "lineNo": 79,
    "speaker": "Spike",
    "dialogue": "Yeah! This is gonna be the best night ever. You know why? 'Cause we're all gonna spend time at the Gala to-oooaah! ...gether. Or not."
