    "episodeId": 55,
    "seasonNo": 3,
    "episodeNo": 4,
    "id": 12005,
    "lineNo": 184,
    "speaker": "Applejack",
    "dialogue": "Yup. She came up to the farm to get away from all her problems back home. I'm so proud of y'all. You've done a good deed."
