    "episodeId": 94,
    "seasonNo": 5,
    "episodeNo": 4,
    "id": 19724,
    "lineNo": 73,
    "speaker": "Apple Bloom",
    "dialogue": "[sighs] I hate to think that Diamond Tiara is right, but... this cutie mark sure isn't what I was hoping for."
