    "episodeId": 94,
    "seasonNo": 5,
    "episodeNo": 4,
    "id": 19748,
    "lineNo": 97,
    "speaker": "Applejack",
    "dialogue": "See, now what did I tell you? A good night's sleep'll fix just about\u2014 [gasps] Well, no wonder you were so worked up!"
